  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "FemtoRV-Morph - Notes",
      "source_hash": 13612627408235244154,
      "context_hash": 6276340275061695746,
      "translation": "FemtoRV-Morph - 노트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FemtoRV": "FemtoRV"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978393Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Mission statement: create a Risc-V processor with an _interesting_ capabilities/complexity/performance ratio.",
      "source_hash": 16023845547329650989,
      "context_hash": 16848296370395088437,
      "translation": "목표 선언: *흥미로운* 능력/복잡도/성능 비율을 갖는 RISC-V 프로세서를 만드는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978394Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The main idea is to start from an RV32ICZicsr core like Gracilis, add the instructions that have an interesting area/performance ratio (e.g., MUL variants and a subset of RV32F) and implement the rest in software traps.",
      "source_hash": 16391623769251881805,
      "context_hash": 15335003440669667599,
      "translation": "주된 아이디어는 Gracilis와 같은 RV32ICZicsr 코어에서 출발하여, 흥미로운 면적/성능 비율을 갖는 명령어(예: MUL 계열과 RV32F의 일부 서브셋)를 추가하고, 나머지는 소프트웨어 트랩으로 구현하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978394Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "There would be two versions, Caterpillar and QuickSilver (abbreviated Hg).",
      "source_hash": 14552421566555894530,
      "context_hash": 5646591734159078108,
      "translation": "Caterpillar와 QuickSilver(약칭 Hg), 두 가지 버전이 있을 예정입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978395Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "FemtoRVMorph-Caterpillar",
      "source_hash": 12870976596302889304,
      "context_hash": 1095148502906444216,
      "translation": "FemtoRVMorph-Caterpillar",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978395Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "RV32ICZicsr (Gracilis base)",
      "source_hash": 4141359081212297691,
      "context_hash": 10401807137411089241,
      "translation": "RV32ICZicsr (Gracilis 기반)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978395Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "RV32M: MUL, MULH, MULHSU, MULHU (DIV, DIVU, REM, REMU in sw trap)",
      "source_hash": 12229865856553712274,
      "context_hash": 17302032342792800986,
      "translation": "RV32M: MUL, MULH, MULHSU, MULHU (DIV, DIVU, REM, REMU는 sw 트랩으로)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978395Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Implement a subset of RV32F (separate fp registers) or Zfinx (shared registers) Zfinx may be the way to go (much simpler datapath, smaller nb instructions), and Zfinx could be used to emulate RV32F in trap !",
      "source_hash": 10787853402316380442,
      "context_hash": 952775374239449709,
      "translation": "RV32F의 서브셋(별도의 fp 레지스터) 또는 Zfinx(공유 레지스터)를 구현합니다. Zfinx가 나아갈 방향일 수 있습니다(훨씬 단순한 데이터패스, 더 적은 명령어 수), 그리고 Zfinx를 사용해 RV32F를 트랩으로 에뮬레이션할 수도 있습니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978395Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "It is mostly a FMA (Fused-Multiply-Add) unit, used to implement:",
      "source_hash": 6168501313155984900,
      "context_hash": 14159978773258633235,
      "translation": "이것은 주로 FMA(Fused-Multiply-Add) 유닛으로, 다음을 구현하는 데 사용됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978395Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Sum and product: FADD, FSUB, FMUL, FMADD, FMSUB, FNMADD, FNMSUB",
      "source_hash": 11761771324715955769,
      "context_hash": 14010462969991843236,
      "translation": "합과 곱: FADD, FSUB, FMUL, FMADD, FMSUB, FNMADD, FNMSUB",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978395Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Comparison: FEQ, FLT, FLE",
      "source_hash": 9598145338697267186,
      "context_hash": 3499392314745745128,
      "translation": "비교: FEQ, FLT, FLE",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978395Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Load/Store (RV32F): FLW, FSW",
      "source_hash": 10866732938978138314,
      "context_hash": 1487810889715618231,
      "translation": "로드/스토어 (RV32F): FLW, FSW",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978395Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "integer reg <-> fp reg (RV32F): FMVXW, FMVWX",
      "source_hash": 10157413163999965770,
      "context_hash": 11096759245224221426,
      "translation": "정수 레지스터 <-> fp 레지스터 (RV32F): FMVXW, FMVWX",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978395Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "All the rest in sw trap",
      "source_hash": 18127355618255012395,
      "context_hash": 13460857512218154948,
      "translation": "나머지는 전부 sw 트랩으로 처리합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978395Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
