      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "MCT (Minimal Cost Trap) mechanism: cooperation between illegal instruction trap mechanism and address prediction logic, fast context switch logic",
      "source_hash": 17946797264662877557,
      "context_hash": 5712081956015199069,
      "translation": "MCT(Minimal Cost Trap, 최소 비용 트랩) 메커니즘: 불법 명령어 트랩 메커니즘과 주소 예측 로직, 고속 컨텍스트 스위치 로직 간의 협력입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978396Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Pipelined FMA unit",
      "source_hash": 8093536402144978665,
      "context_hash": 17611785766543997918,
      "translation": "파이프라인화된 FMA 유닛",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978396Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Some sort of Conway/Scoreboard/Tomasulo dynamic execution mechanism to make best use of pipelined FMA unit",
      "source_hash": 6947591480955946628,
      "context_hash": 13071044337516764216,
      "translation": "파이프라인화된 FMA 유닛을 최대한 활용하기 위한 일종의 Conway/Scoreboard/Tomasulo 동적 실행 메커니즘입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:43.978396Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
